; form (a load and a constant) and whose result goes straight back to memory.
; The value never needs to exist in the promoted, one-element-per-lane form, so
; the select can be done on a legal type of the same width instead of on one
; element per lane.

define void @select_v32i4(i1 %cond, ptr %p, ptr %out) {
; SSE2-LABEL: select_v32i4:
